## Game Concept

<!-- Explain why the working title fits. Mention alternative titles if useful. -->
[The title Retro Kick represents a simple, old-school soccer game where players use their fingers to control a ball. The name connects to the classic feeling of playing a simple physical game.]

<!-- Describe the setting, theme, and story or premise. Identify the characters
or the role the player takes. A game without a story can describe its situation
and player roles instead; do not invent a narrative just to fill this section. -->
[Retro Kick is a physical soccer-style game where players compete against each other to score goals. Each player controls the ball using their fingers and tries to move it toward the opponent's goal. The goal is to score as many times as possible before the timer runs out.]

## Gameplay

<!-- Explain the player's objectives, the conflicts or challenges, and how play
