Describe the intended experience through those interactions. -->
[The main objective is to score more goals than the opponent before time runs out. Players must control the ball with their fingers, move it across the field, and find opportunities to shoot toward the goal.]
[The main challenge is controlling the ball accurately while trying to score. Players must decide when to move the ball, when to shoot, and how to avoid losing control.]

